                      "fill": "$foreground",
                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                      "width": "fill_container",
                      "content": "Set at sixteen pixels with a line height of 1.5 — twenty-four pixels between baselines — this is the setting every multi-line passage in the library uses. It gives descenders and ascenders room to breathe across several lines without the block feeling loose, and it keeps a comfortable measure when the container is between sixty and eighty characters wide. Longer passages should be broken into separate paragraphs rather than stretched to the full width of a page frame; the reading eye loses the start of the next line beyond roughly eighty characters.",
